        "original_id": "5b18a038-0925-5eff-8762-a26adf614a9b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jesse Williams, Jackson Avery, Rev. James Lawson\n- Works: Lee Daniels' The Butler, Invasion\n- Organizations: Mercy West Medical Center, Seattle Grace Hospital\n- Topics: Grey's Anatomy character introduction, film casting, hospital merger\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Jesse Williams appeared in the film Lee Daniels' The Butler as civil rights leader Rev. James Lawson.\n- Jackson Avery was introduced in season 6, episode 5, Invasion, as a former surgical resident from Mercy West Medical Center.\n- Jackson Avery entered the story when Mercy West Medical Center merged with Seattle Grace Hospital.",
